{"AFTER_FIGHT","tmp=fresh",{"Is everybody-- is everybody still here? Count off!","Don't touch me yet - sorry, just-- give me a minute","Okay, I'm okay, I think I'm... okay","Hands won't stop shaking - it's over, why won't they stop?","Don't say I did good, please - I just need to breathe","Thought that was it, holy shit, I thought that was IT"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"I'm shaking! Why am I shaking? It's over!"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","tmp=veteran",{"Check yourselves over. Don't ignore a wound","Reload before you sit, every time, reload before you sit"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","tmp=seasoned",{"That was too close, that was way, way too close"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","role=rescue_medical|mood=warm",{"Sit down and drink some water before you do anything else"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","tmp=veteran|mood=grim",{"Anybody bit? Look at me and say it","Noise like that carries, we don't stay here","We're all still breathing, I'll take it"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","role=soldier_nco,swat_lead,law_sergeant",{"Don't stand in the open congratulating yourselves, move"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","tmp=seasoned|hour=16,5|mood=grim",{"I keep seeing his face, I'll see it tonight too"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,crime,club,prison|tmp=veteran",{"Strip what's useful and go - two minutes"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","role=rescue_clergy,family_elder|mood=sad",{"Say a word over him, somebody say a word"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","tmp=seasoned,veteran|hour=16,20",{"Get the wounded inside before dark, move it"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","",{"I need a minute before I talk about that","My hands haven't got the message yet","I keep thinking I should say something","Well. That was a thing I never wanted to do","Don't ask me how I feel just yet","I could do without another one of those","All that noise, and now I can't think","Give me a moment to be a person again","I was scared. Still am, a little","I don't want to get used to this","I'm not much for talking right now","That took something out of me","Can we take a breath before the next thing?","I need to stop thinking about the worst bit","Is it over? Is it over? It's over","Holy shit, holy shit, holy SHIT","Breathe... we're okay, we're okay","Everybody alright? Sound off!","I'm shaking, look at my hands, I can't stop","Still alive, still alive, still alive","Whoo! Way too close, jeez","My heart is going to explode, feel it","That's all of them, I think, that's all of them","Quiet, finally quiet","Ha, ha, ha, we did it, we actually did it","I need to sit down, my legs are gone","I need a minute. Can't get my breath","Hell of a fight, hell of a fight","Check yourself for bites, everyone, check yourself, now","Adrenaline's wearing off, ow, ow, I think I pulled something","Did anyone get hurt? Anyone? Speak up","Nobody go wandering off - wait a second","Need to sit down, no, I'm fine - just need to sit","Can we be done with this shit for today? Please?"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=law",{"Everybody alright? Talk to me","Somebody's going to have to write this up - someday","Check for injuries before we go on","Everybody still breathing? Good, sit down a sec","Count the casualties - report in","Report in - who's hit?"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=law|world=road",{"I need a minute - watch the road"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=swat",{"Sound off - anybody hit?","Reload and check your partner","Good work, stay alert","Check each other. Don't overlook anything","Check on each other before we do anything else","Who's hit? Who needs help?"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=military,elite",{"Reload and share out the ammo before anybody sits down","Check your buddy for bites","Good job, don't get comfortable","How is everybody? Tell me what you need","Check yourselves before we do anything else","Good fire discipline, everyone, well done","We got through that. Let's keep it that way"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Is it over? Is everybody okay?","My hands won't stop shaking","I think I'm going to be sick","Is it over? Is it really over?","I'm shaking - look at my hands, they won't stop","We made it, we actually made it","I need to sit down, just for a minute","I never want to do that again - never","Is everyone all right? Count off - please"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=raider,outlaw,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Whoo! Anybody else feel alive?","Grab what they dropped","That's what happens when you mess with us"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=military",{"How's everybody? Say if you need help!","All right, take five - reload"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=elite",{"Done - move"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Ha! That's how it's done!","Anybody hurt? Anybody dead?","Loot the bodies, we earned it","Anybody bleeding? Tell me now","Ha, ha, ha, they never saw it coming","HELL yeah! Who's next?!","Whoo, adrenaline's pumping, pumping","That was fun, that was fun, fuck that was fun","Check what they had on 'em, and who's short on bullets","Anyone hurt? Anyone bleeding? Anyone scared? ha, kidding"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=military,swat,elite",{"Secure the area - check for wounded"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Oh God, oh God, I'm alive, I can't believe I'm alive","Did you see that? Did you see how close it got?!","I thought that was it, I really did","I'm gonna be sick, hold on, hold on","Please nobody be bit, please","I don't want to do that again, I don't, I can't, I won't","I killed it, didn't I? I actually killed it","My ears are ringing, and everything is slow"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=warm",{"We're okay, we're all okay, come here, come here","I love you guys, I love you all, that was too close","Thank you, thank you, you saved my life, you did"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=sad",{"I knew her, that one, I knew her, I used to work with her","That was somebody's son, wasn't it? Somebody's son"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Check for bites, check everyone, strip down if you have to","Reload, reposition, drink water, then we move","Clean the blades, clean the barrels, don't leave blood on the gear","Noise draws more, we can't stay here, let's move","Good work, everyone, now breathe, then pack up","Wash off before you touch your face, all of you"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"Well, that was fun, let's never do that again, ha","My knees are done for the day, ha, hah, ha","Remind me to buy a bigger can of bug spray, hah"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=angry",{"Son of a bitch, son of a BITCH, come back here, I'm not done","Damn them, damn every one of them"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=rescue",{"Check the wounded, triage, who's worst first","Everyone sit, I'll check you, one by one"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","role=rescue_medical",{"Hands, show me your hands, any scratches? Any bites? Be honest","Vitals first, nerves second, wounds third, let's go"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","role=rescue_clergy",{"Thank you, Lord, thank you, for sparing us today","Rest in peace, all of them, Lord have mercy"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Same adrenaline as a bad fire, same shakes after, you get used to it"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=law,swat",{"Anybody hit? Don't keep it to yourself","Secure the perimeter, accounting for everyone, make it quick","Debrief later, bandages now","I need a moment. Check on each other"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=law,swat|tmp=veteran",{"Take a minute, then another, then back to work"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=law,swat|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"I froze, Sarge, I froze, I'm sorry, I'm so sorry","Is this normal? The shaking? Is that normal?"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Again, fine, again, walk it off, move out"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=military,elite|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Sarge, I think I'm going to throw up, is that okay?","I can't feel my hands, Sarge, I can't feel them"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Sweet, sweet carnage, I love it, I love every second of it"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|mood=angry",{"Those motherfuckers, those goddamn motherfuckers"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|mood=fear",{"Fuck, I almost died, I almost died, you saw that","Oh shit, am I bleeding? Look at me, am I bleeding?"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","hour=21,4",{"In the dark, in the dark, that was the worst, I couldn't see anything","Nights like this, I can't tell friend from foe, thank God it's over"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","hour=7,17",{"In broad daylight, no less, as if nothing mattered"}},
{"AFTER_FIGHT","tmp=seasoned,veteran",{"Check for cuts - everybody, check","Check yourselves. Make sure you're not hurt"}},
