{"AREA_CLEAR","",{"Area's clear","All clear, all clear","Nothing in sight","It's clear, nothing moving","The place is empty, finally","No more of them, not a one","We cleared it, we actually cleared it","Not a single one left","It's over, it's over, you can come out"}},
