{"BANTER_INTRO","reg=law",{"Y'all want to hear about the worst call I ever took?","Okay, here's one from the station","Did I ever tell you about the man who called in a flying saucer over the Kroger?"}},
{"BANTER_INTRO","reg=swat",{"Story time - listen up","Here's one from training","Okay, this one's true"}},
{"BANTER_INTRO","reg=military,elite",{"Alright, gather round, this one's good","You hear the one about the lieutenant and the map?","Got a story from basic - listen","Hey, buddy, you got any family back home?","Heard something funny on the radio, thought I'd share","Here's one from basic, listen up","Gather round, this one's a classic"}},
{"BANTER_INTRO","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Oh. I've got one, okay, okay, listen","You want to hear something funny? I need something funny","My uncle used to tell this one","Oh. I've got a good one, listen to this","Wait till you hear what happened to my cousin Earl","Okay, story time, nobody laugh, it's serious","You'll love this one, well, I think you'll love it"}},
{"BANTER_INTRO","reg=raider,outlaw,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Shut up, I got a good one","Listen to this, you're gonna love it","So me and Dwayne, right?"}},
{"BANTER_INTRO","",{"Hey, you awake?","Hey, can I tell you something?","Psst, hey, come here a sec","So, I was thinking about something","Hey, you ever think about what we'd be doing right now, normally?","Okay, serious question","You still got that candy bar? Just kidding, just kidding","Quick question","Hey, you wanna hear something stupid?","I've been wondering about this for days","Guess what I just remembered","Hey, you ever get a song stuck in your head?","Can I ask you something kind of weird?","Tell me about your hometown"}},
{"BANTER_INTRO","world=water",{"Remember that time at the, the lake?"}},
{"BANTER_INTRO","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Can we talk? I need to talk, I need to hear someone talk","Hey, are you scared? Be honest, are you scared?"}},
{"BANTER_INTRO","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Hey, got a minute? Nothing urgent","Pull up a seat, let's pass the time"}},
{"BANTER_INTRO","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"Oh, you gotta hear this one","Settle down, settle down, I've got a story"}},
{"BANTER_INTRO","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=warm",{"Hey, I wanted to say something, I don't say it enough"}},
{"BANTER_INTRO","reg=law,swat",{"Hey, partner, you got a sec?","Remember that call on the interstate? The one with the horse?","You ever heard about the time I pulled over a clown?","Listen to this, true story, you won't believe it"}},
{"BANTER_INTRO","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Hey, listen up, I got a story","Psst, boss, you hear that rumor?","Oh man, you're gonna love this, so I'm sitting in handcuffs at the sheriff's office...","Shut up and listen, this is gold"}},
{"BANTER_INTRO","hour=21,4",{"Can't sleep, you can't sleep either, can you","Hey, you up? Since we're both up, talk to me"}},
{"BANTER_INTRO","reg=family",{"Let me tell you what happened when I was just a girl"}},
{"BANTER_REACTION","reg=law",{"Ha - Lord, that's awful","I've heard worse, not much worse","Heh, I'll allow it"}},
{"BANTER_REACTION","reg=swat",{"Ha, okay, that's good","Terrible - tell another","Heh"}},
{"BANTER_REACTION","reg=military,elite",{"Ha. Had me going there","Worst joke I ever heard - tell it again","Heh - good one","Roger that, that's a good one","Heh, solid, I'll use that one","Ha. Needed that","Heh, that's rich"}},
{"BANTER_REACTION","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Oh my gosh... you didn't","That's terrible. I love it","Hah, I needed that","Ha. Oh my God, that's terrible, I love it","Haha, no way, no WAY, that actually happened?","Ugh, that's awful, tell it again","Ha, I needed that, thanks"}},
{"BANTER_REACTION","reg=raider,outlaw,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Hah. Good one","That ain't funny, okay, it's a little funny","Dumbest thing I ever heard. Tell it again"}},
{"BANTER_REACTION","",{"Ha, no way","Seriously? You're kidding","Go on, I'm listening","That's hilarious, that's actually hilarious","Oh my God, stop it","Yeah, I've heard that one, it's still funny","Wow, I did not know that","Hmm, that's interesting","Shut up, you did not","That's the best thing I've heard all day","Hah, I needed that","Uh huh, uh huh, keep going","You're crazy, you know that?","Right? That's what I said","Ha. You waited all day to tell that one?","Ugh, that's terrible, tell me another"}},
{"BANTER_REACTION","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=sad",{"I wish I'd known you before all of this","That's so sweet, you're making me cry"}},
{"BANTER_REACTION","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Mm-hmm, mm-hmm, I follow","Interesting, go on, I've got time"}},
{"BANTER_REACTION","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"Hahaha, stop, stop, my side hurts, oh God","Oh that's good, that's real good, bless your heart"}},
{"BANTER_REACTION","reg=law,swat",{"Ha, that sounds about right","10-4 on that, you got me","Ha, classic","Heh, you're something else"}},
{"BANTER_REACTION","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Ha, no shit? No shit","Heh, you wish","Shut your mouth, that's not true, is it","Hahahaha, damn, that's good","Ha, you're a riot"}},
{"BANTER_REACTION","reg=family",{"My sides hurt, stop it, stop it"}},
{"BITE_AVOIDED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"It almost got me! It almost bit me!","Oh God, that was close - teeth! Right there!","I'm okay - I'm okay - it missed"}},
{"BITE_AVOIDED","reg=law",{"It nearly got me, didn't break skin - clear","Close, teeth inches from my arm"}},
{"BITE_AVOIDED","reg=swat",{"Missed bite - clear"}},
{"BITE_AVOIDED","reg=military",{"Almost got me! I'm good! I'm good!","Bite avoided - let's go"}},
{"BITE_AVOIDED","reg=elite",{"It didn't get me. Don't let it try again"}},
{"BITE_AVOIDED","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Almost took a chunk out of me!","Get that thing off me! It tried to bite!","Damn thing missed - its mistake","Fucking thing almost got me"}},
{"BITE_AVOIDED","",{"Whoa, whoa, that was close","Did it bite me? Did it bite me?","Teeth, I felt teeth, almost","Missed me, it missed me","God, another inch and it had me","Stay back, don't touch me!","Look at my arms, my neck, did it get me?","Nothing? Nothing? No bite?","That was SO close","I felt its breath on me, ugh"}},
