{"CAMP_CHATTER","tmp=veteran|hour=19,5",{"Keep the fire low, light travels further than courage","Nobody wanders off to piss alone - nobody"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","hour=19,23|mood=funny",{"Who's got first watch? Don't all shout at once"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","tmp=seasoned|hour=20,2",{"Wake me at two, actually wake me, don't be polite"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","role=rescue_medical,worker",{"Boil it twice, I don't care how clear it looks"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","tmp=veteran",{"Dry your socks, wet feet will end you slower than they will","Count the food out loud so everybody trusts it"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","reg=worker,military,family|world=water,rain",{"Rain's coming in off the river - get the tarps up"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","tmp=seasoned|hour=18,4|world=cold",{"Cold snap tonight, double up the blankets"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","hour=19,23|mood=warm",{"Sing something quiet, something from before all this"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","tmp=veteran|mood=warm",{"Two hours' sleep is better than none - lie down"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","hour=20,23|mood=funny",{"Whoever snores tonight is on dawn watch tomorrow"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","reg=law|world=building",{"There's a typewriter down in the station basement, every time I walk by it I feel a little safer - don't ask me why"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","reg=law",{"Anybody else still hear the radio tones in their sleep?","I keep writing the date in my notebook, somebody ought to keep track","If the sheriff were here he'd tell us to quit gabbing and get some sleep","Tomorrow we check the houses on Pruitt Lane, early, before the heat","Radio check - anybody on channel six?","Check the perimeter, I want a headcount by dark","Who took the last coffee? Seriously"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","reg=swat",{"Lights out at ten, I mean it this time","Who's got first watch? Not me - good","Somebody tell a story, a boring one","Our old team leader would've hated this, he liked a plan","Get some rest - tomorrow's long","Gear check - five minutes","Rotate the watch, two hours each"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","reg=military,elite",{"Somebody got cards? I'll play anybody for cigarettes","You hear from your folks before the lines went down? Yeah - me neither","Keep the fire small, you can see it a long way off out here","Specialist, quit cleaning that rifle - it's clean","Two more weeks and I'd have been out - two weeks","Pass the word, chow in five","Clean your weapons, oil them, check them again","Someone keep an eye on Davis, he's quiet, and quiet worries me","Keep it down, the boys are sleeping","Anyone got a harmonica? Play something, kid","Rations are warm, eat up"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Does anybody know any songs? Real quiet ones?","My grandma used to say the Lord never gives you more than you can handle - I'd like a word with her","If we ever get out of here I'm going to eat a whole pie - by myself","Tell me something nice - anything, make it up if you have to","Kids finally fell asleep - talk quiet","Hmm hm hmmm, la la, no, that's not it, hm hm hmmm","Anybody else's feet hurt, or is it just me and my sad little toes?","I can taste bacon, actually taste it, and there's no bacon, my brain is broken","Does anyone know how to make a rope? Asking for a friend, the friend is me","Who snores like a chainsaw? Don't lie, I can hear it from here","My back is trying to leave my body, I can feel it packing a bag","Would anyone trade me a clean sock for a dirty joke? I've got a great one","Somebody tell me something good, anything, I'll pay in beans","If we find a bathtub, I get it first, no arguments, I've been patient","Does anyone remember the words to the second verse? I only know the first","I've never been so tired and so awake at the same time, how is that possible?","Anyone want to trade stories? I'll start: my cat once ate a whole rotisserie chicken","I'm cold, but I'm too tired to move closer to the others","Hm hm hm, I've got a song stuck in my head, and I can't remember the name","Does anyone else get tired of beans? Just checking, I'm not crazy","Where's my other sock? I put it right here, right here, never mind","Someone pass the beans, and if you're the one who ate all the peaches, I'm watching you","Anybody know any good songs? We need something other than silence","I'd love a hot bath, a hot bath, and a book, and a nap, in that order","Somebody talk, I can't stand this quiet, just keep it low"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","reg=raider,outlaw,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Pass the bottle, man - don't hog it","Who's got the cards? Deal me in","You hear that? No sirens, never thought I'd miss sirens","Tomorrow we hit the gas station on 31W - early","That guy today cried like a baby - you see that?"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","reg=civilian|world=hot",{"Anybody want coffee? It's instant, but it's hot"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","reg=civilian",{"I keep hearing a dog in the distance - do you think someone's feeding it?","Who's got the next watch?"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","reg=family",{"Kids, wash your hands, I don't care if the water's cold","Don't wander off, stay where I can see you","Come closer, everyone, let's share the blanket, there's room","Somebody pass Grandma a pillow, she's nodding off again","Nap time, little ones, nap time for the brave and the tired","Come closer, everyone, there's room for all of you"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","reg=family|hour=16,5",{"We've got enough for tonight, tomorrow I'll go look"}},
