{"CAMP_CHATTER","st=friendly,neutral",{"Somebody's been naming the stray chickens, the big one is Senator"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","reg=military,swat,elite",{"Who put a hat on the sandbag? Take it off - it looks smarter than the lieutenant"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|hour=20,5",{"I've been counting the stars, I'm up to seventy, give or take"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Is it just me, or is every little noise the loudest noise ever?","I keep reaching for my phone to check the time, and then I remember","Can I ask a dumb question? What day is it? I lost count","I wish I had a pillow, a pillow, my kingdom for a pillow"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Don't wake the baby, don't wake the baby, ugh, too late","Same crackers, different night, I should write a book","Nobody ever tells you that the hardest part is the boredom","If I hear one more person say 'it's quiet,' I'm going to scream, quietly"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","reg=law,swat",{"Anyone want to play cards? I've got a deck, missing the queen of hearts","Rotation's posted, so check it, and don't whine about your shift","Cold coffee's still coffee, don't knock it","Anyone got a spare pencil? I want to jot down the count","Anybody got a deck of cards? I'll deal","Remember the fish fry at the lodge? Best catfish in the county"}},
{"CAMP_CHATTER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Hey, you, stop hogging the bottle, I can hear you gulping","Somebody tell a story, or I'll tell one, and nobody wants that","Pass me my knife, I need to cut something, I'm bored","Anyone seen my boots? Nobody? Great, I'll steal yours","Pass the bottle, you hog","Anyone got a joke? I need a laugh before bed","Pass the bottle, stop hogging it"}},
